# Review rules for the morning review board (.datacore/lib/review_board.py).
#
# Copy to review_rules.local.yaml (gitignored) and edit there. Without that
# file, or with this one as shipped, NOTHING passes without you: every item in
# REVIEW comes to the board.
#
# auto_pass: review types that may pass without you, but only when BOTH hold
# on the task:
#   - its tests are green          (:TESTS: green, 41 passed)
#   - a reviewer from a different model family passed it
#                                  (:SECOND_REVIEW: pass, :SECOND_REVIEW_MODEL:
#                                   compared with the producer's :MODEL:)
# A task's type is its :REVIEW_TYPE: or :AI_TYPE: property, else its :AI:<type>:
# tag (research, content, data, pm, technical), else "general".
# Passed rows still appear on the board, in their own section, pre-set to
# Accept; nothing is applied until you say so.
#
# Never passed without you, whatever is listed here: release, security,
# money, credentials and public posts. Listing one is refused, and a task whose
# type, tags or title touches one of them always comes to you.
#
# Example:
# auto_pass:
#   - research
#   - data
auto_pass: []
